From 7eba7a96bbb7f0b17213ac52e00aabf6345d301e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 11:47:15 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] docs(process): merge-ready and needs-rework never coexist

A PR never has `merge-ready` and `needs-rework` together. The agent that
sets one removes the other in the same `gh pr edit` call and comments why.
An open change request wins over `merge-ready` of another collaborator.
Replaces the "disagreement: no agent removes a label" text for these two
labels in AGENTS.md, merge-ready, review-prs, resolve-conflicts and
PR-reviewer.

Fixes #3382

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
